    "title": "Who Wants to be a Rich",
    "description": "Description:\t\r\n\r\nThe large selection of questions in our app is ready to test your mind! Who Wants to be a Rich is an exciting quiz where you can test your knowledge and win virtual millions! Answer questions from various fields and become a real connoisseur. Three levels of difficulty are available in the game: easy, medium and difficult, allowing everyone to choose the right challenge.\r\n\r\nHow to play:\r\n\r\n1) Choose the difficulty level: easy, medium or difficult.\r\n2) Answer the questions by choosing one of the four options offered.\r\n3) For each correct answer, you move up to the next level and earn points and get one step closer to victory.\r\n\r\nHints:\r\nIf you're not sure of the answer, use one of the hints:\r\n50:50 - removes two incorrect choices.\r\nHelp - gives an additional explanation or tip. \r\n\r\nQuestion topics:\r\nThe questions cover a wide range of topics. This allows you to not only test your knowledge, but also learn something interesting.\r\n\r\nInterface and Graphics:\r\nThe game has an attractive and intuitive design reminiscent of casino style. Green control buttons and brightly colored elements create an atmosphere of success. Pleasant animations and graphic elements make the gameplay exciting and engaging.\r\n\r\nDownload Who Wants to be a Rich and start your journey to victory! Test your knowledge, use the hints and become a real winner!",
